    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273110/extras/9b7d60b246e558b1c8f3cd7b0cac411a.avif?t=1729876737\" /></span><br><br>An adventuring guild hall was built in the country side, atop the mouth of an ancient portcullis. Beyond the steel and stone gate lies the twisting expanse of the <strong>DUNJUN</strong>, filled with vile monsters and deadly traps. Aspirants travel from lands near and far to delve into the <strong>DUNJUN</strong>\u2019s timeless depths, seeking treasure, knowledge, and fame alike. Time has forgotten the <strong>DUNJUN</strong>\u2019s origins, but many a rumor escapes the lips of bards, scholars, and soldiers.<br><br>In <strong>DUNJUNGUY</strong>, a party of up to four friends can test their might against the hordes of creatures in the <strong>DUNJUN</strong>. Combining Action RPG mainstays with mechanics familiar to Roguelike fans, players can choose abilities, find powerful gear, and navigate procedurally generated environments while staving off impending doom. <strong>DUNJUNGUY</strong> delivers a cartoony visual style, contrasted by its exploration of macabre and moody touchstones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273110/extras/cbc32dcb9da4739c7cee1008b553eb48.avif?t=1729876737\" /></span><br>In this couch co-op dungeon-crawler you and four friends venture into the depths of a dark dungeon where enemies, traps, and loot await! Play up to 4 different classes, level up your abilities, and explore a variety of unique and handcrafted dungeons where peril awaits around every turn. After surviving each round of the <strong>DUNJUN</strong> your party may find respite in the Tavern, a place to sell loot, upgrade your player, and chat with the locals. Once you have proved your mettle as a brave adventurer <strong>DUNJUNGUY</strong> himself may permit you to enter the deepest depths of the <strong>DUNJUN</strong> where fame, glory, knowledge, and riches beyond your wildest imagination await.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273110/extras/9b7d60b246e558b1c8f3cd7b0cac411a.avif?t=1729876737\" /></span><br><br>An adventuring guild hall was built in the country side, atop the mouth of an ancient portcullis. Beyond the steel and stone gate lies the twisting expanse of the <strong>DUNJUN</strong>, filled with vile monsters and deadly traps. Aspirants travel from lands near and far to delve into the <strong>DUNJUN</strong>\u2019s timeless depths, seeking treasure, knowledge, and fame alike. Time has forgotten the <strong>DUNJUN</strong>\u2019s origins, but many a rumor escapes the lips of bards, scholars, and soldiers.<br><br>In <strong>DUNJUNGUY</strong>, a party of up to four friends can test their might against the hordes of creatures in the <strong>DUNJUN</strong>. Combining Action RPG mainstays with mechanics familiar to Roguelike fans, players can choose abilities, find powerful gear, and navigate procedurally generated environments while staving off impending doom. <strong>DUNJUNGUY</strong> delivers a cartoony visual style, contrasted by its exploration of macabre and moody touchstones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273110/extras/cbc32dcb9da4739c7cee1008b553eb48.avif?t=1729876737\" /></span><br>In this couch co-op dungeon-crawler you and four friends venture into the depths of a dark dungeon where enemies, traps, and loot await! Play up to 4 different classes, level up your abilities, and explore a variety of unique and handcrafted dungeons where peril awaits around every turn. After surviving each round of the <strong>DUNJUN</strong> your party may find respite in the Tavern, a place to sell loot, upgrade your player, and chat with the locals. Once you have proved your mettle as a brave adventurer <strong>DUNJUNGUY</strong> himself may permit you to enter the deepest depths of the <strong>DUNJUN</strong> where fame, glory, knowledge, and riches beyond your wildest imagination await.",
